  "details": "Take up the action menu, go to options, press on configuration and turn on AFK Detection, pull up the steam vr menu and then get off your headset. \n\nWhen you get back to your headset, your avatars reset default style but it looks normal in your face mirror. You're animation movement freeze and your hands freeze as well, can't use any hand gestures. A few seconds later your mouth freeze.\n\n If you try to fix it by turning AFK Detection off nothing happens and if you turn it on and off again to try and reset it, it can freeze you in afk mode by turning the big menu on and then off. \n\nAfter waiting for a while trying to deal it fixed itself, but I'll never use AFK Detection again until it may get fixed",
